{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54578","headline":"兵要望江南 占雾第五（京本列第八○十首） 八 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雾第五（京本列第八○十首） 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城（京本作「军」）营内，大雾起城头。\n白色似（京本作「沙」）烟兵战起（辛本、川本、京本作「喜」），三朝五日簇戈矛，准备好（京本作「防备外」）方游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}